OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies told food waste cut can
OL,4,Asave #1k a year
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies are being asked to reduce the
OL,7,Famount of food they throw away after it
OL,8,Fwas revealed their serviceable waste
OL,9,Fcould be worth about #1,000 every year.
OL,11,FGuernsey Waste is encouraging people to
OL,12,Ffind alternative ways to use food as
OL,13,Fpart of its Love Food, Hate Waste
OL,14,Fcampaign.
OL,16,FIt said 60 tonnes of food waste was
OL,17,Fcollected from households every week,
OL,18,Fand a lot of that came from buying too
OL,19,Fmuch and it going off, or it being
OL,20,Fstored incorrectly.
