OL,5,
OL,6,FA free soup giveaway at Market Square,
OL,7,FSt Peter Port, on Monday had a focus on
OL,8,Fpumpkins and different recipes for over
OL,9,FHalloween. Guernsey Waste said the
OL,10,Fautumnal vegetable was worth "so much
OL,11,Fmore than just a carving in your window
OL,12,For on your doorstep".
